<http://fairness_ontology.com/InstanceWeighting> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <http://fairness_ontology.com/FeatureLevelRowReweightingResampling> ;
                                                 rdfs:label "Instance Weighting" .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/ItemFocusedMetric
<http://fairness_ontology.com/ItemFocusedMetric> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <http://fairness_ontology.com/SubjectMetric> ;
                                                 rdfs:label "Item-focused Metric"@en .


