                                          rdfs:subClassOf <http://fairness_ontology.com/InstanceLevelRowIntervention> ;
                                          rdfs:label "Relabeling" .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Reranking
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Reranking> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                         rdfs:subClassOf <http://fairness_ontology.com/BlackBoxDecisionOnly> ;
                                         rdfs:label "Re-ranking" .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/ScientificArtifact
<http://fairness_ontology.com/ScientificArtifact> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                  rdfs:label "Scientific Artifact"@en ;
                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A scientific artifact is the outcome with which the the paper contributes, such as a fairness notion, metric, and so on."@en .


