###  http://fairness_ontology.com/SufficiencyFairnessNotion
<http://fairness_ontology.com/SufficiencyFairnessNotion> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                         rdfs:subClassOf <http://fairness_ontology.com/GroupFairnessNotion> ;
                                                         <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/source> "https://doi.org/10.1145/3468507.3468511"^^xsd:anyURI ;
                                                         <http://semanticscience.org/resource/hasSynonym> "sufficiency fairness"@en ;
                                                         rdfs:label "Sufficiency Fairness Notion"@en ;
                                                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The fairness property satisfied when a target variable is independent of protected attributes, conditionally on the predicted outcome variable."@en ;
                                                         <https://purl.org/twc/fmo#probabilistic_definition> "Y ⊥ A | Ŷ"@en .


