<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.10> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/TechnicalLegalRequirement> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/ConditionalStatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairnessThroughAwareness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/IndividualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/itsComplianceIsSupportedWith> <http://fairness_ontology.com/AddNonToxicExamples> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/AugmentedAntidoteData> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/BlocklistDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/CDA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ControlOffensiveTokens> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/GenderneutralAlternatives> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PredictedReplacements> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/REALTOXICITYPROMPTS> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReplaceStereotypes> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Establishes data and data governance requirements for high-risk AI systems, including quality, relevance, representativeness and appropriate statistical properties of training, validation and testing data. Notes: Umbrella provision for data quality and bias control; detailed constraints are set in specific paragraphs." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.10.3
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.10.3> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                 <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                                 <http://fairness_ontology.com/TechnicalLegalRequirement> ;
                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/ConditionalStatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairnessThroughAwareness> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/IndividualFairness> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ;
                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/itsComplianceIsSupportedWith> <http://fairness_ontology.com/AddNonToxicExamples> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/AugmentedAntidoteData> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/BlocklistDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/CDA> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/GenderneutralAlternatives> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReplaceStereotypes> ;
                                        <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                        rdfs:comment "Training, validation and testing data must be relevant, representative, free of errors and complete, with appropriate statistical properties, including where applicable in relation to the persons or groups for whom the system is intended. Notes: Central data-governance requirement on distribution and representativeness for fairness." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.10.4
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.10.4> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                 <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                                 <http://fairness_ontology.com/TechnicalLegalRequirement> ;
                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/ConditionalStatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                           <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/itsComplianceIsSupportedWith> <http://fairness_ontology.com/AugmentedAntidoteData> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/CDA> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/CalibratedReRanking> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/ListReAdjustment> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                    <http://fairness_ontology.com/UserItemReRanking> ;
                                        <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                        rdfs:comment "Datasets shall, to the best extent possible, take into account the specific geographical, behavioural and functional context in which the AI system is intended to be used, so that performance and fairness generalise to the deployment environment. Notes: Addresses fairness risks due to domain shift between training data and the real-world context of use." .


