                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ListReAdjustment> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PerceptronForUnawareness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/REALTOXICITYPROMPTS> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnANOVA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnValueFairness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/UserItemReRanking> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Obliges providers to draw up technical documentation demonstrating compliance with the requirements, including design choices, data sources, model properties, performance and limitations relevant to fairness and non-discrimination. Notes: Traceability layer: binds legal compliance claims to explicit notions, indicators, and documented controls; requires before/after evidence and clear limitations for authority review and conformity assessment." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.112.10
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.112.10> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                   <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                                   <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                          <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                             <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                             <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                             <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                             <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ;
                                          <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                          rdfs:comment "Requires the Commission to evaluate and review the implementation of the Regulation and, where appropriate, propose amendments, taking into account technological developments and the effects of AI systems on health, safety and fundamental rights, including equality and non-discrimination. Notes: This is a governance/evaluation obligation: notions/metrics are mapped as evaluation indicators aggregated across systems (not as system-level compliance targets)." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.12
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.12> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
