                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ControlOffensiveTokens> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ListReAdjustment> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PerceptronForUnawareness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/REALTOXICITYPROMPTS> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnANOVA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnValueFairness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/UserItemReRanking> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Requires providers to ensure that high-risk AI systems are accompanied by clear instructions for use and information about performance, assumptions, limitations and foreseeable risks to fundamental rights. Notes: Operational transparency layer: communicate applicable fairness notions, the metrics used to evidence them (incl. parity, error gaps, counterfactual instability, calibration/divergence), evaluation conditions and limits; document active safeguards and the operational response when monitoring signals degrade." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.14
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.14> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
