                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ControlOffensiveTokens> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/GenderneutralAlternatives> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ListReAdjustment> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/NamesIntervention> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PerceptronForUnawareness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PoliteAlternatives> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PredictedReplacements> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/REALTOXICITYPROMPTS> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnANOVA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnValueFairness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReplaceStereotypes> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/UserItemReRanking> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Sets obligations for distributors of high-risk AI systems to ensure compliance at market placement (e.g., presence of required documentation/instructions and integrity of the supplied system), cooperate with competent authorities, and take actions when non-compliance or risks are suspected. Notes: Distributor-side role is assurance: verify the provider’s conformity package (incl. fairness indicators/limits and declared controls) is present and not neutralised by integration/packaging choices; if issues arise, coordinate corrective actions and preserve traceability to the supplied version." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.25
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.25> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Clarifies responsibilities along the AI value chain for high-risk AI systems, including when another actor becomes the provider (e.g., branding, substantial modification, or purpose change) and related cooperation duties between actors. Notes: Value-chain governance: notions/metrics are mapped as handover anchors for fairness evidence. If accountability shifts, the new provider must inherit and/or regenerate the mapped evidence and monitoring, traceable to the modified version and context of use." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.26
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.26> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/ConditionalStatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairnessThroughAwareness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/IndividualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/itsComplianceIsSupportedWith> <http://fairness_ontology.com/AddNonToxicExamples> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/AdversarialFDP> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/AugmentedAntidoteData> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/BlocklistDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/CDA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/CalibratedReRanking> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ControlOffensiveTokens> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairPSL> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ListReAdjustment> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PerceptronForUnawareness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/REALTOXICITYPROMPTS> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnANOVA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnValueFairness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/UserItemReRanking> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Specifies additional obligations for deployers of high-risk AI systems, including using systems in accordance with instructions and monitoring operation, especially where decisions significantly affect individuals. Notes: Art. 26 is deployer-side operational compliance: implement monitoring KPIs (parity/error gaps/drift/consistency), define thresholds and escalation, apply workflow interventions and (where applicable) corrective controls directly or via provider coordination; evidence effectiveness through improvements in the monitored metrics." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.27
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.27> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/ConditionalStatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairnessThroughAwareness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/IndividualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/itsComplianceIsSupportedWith> <http://fairness_ontology.com/AddNonToxicExamples> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/AdversarialFDP> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/AugmentedAntidoteData> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/BlocklistDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/CDA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/CalibratedReRanking> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ControlOffensiveTokens> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairPSL> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ListReAdjustment> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PerceptronForUnawareness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/REALTOXICITYPROMPTS> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnANOVA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnValueFairness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/UserItemReRanking> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Requires deployers of certain high-risk AI systems to perform a fundamental rights impact assessment (FRIA), identifying and evaluating risks to fundamental rights, including discrimination, and defining mitigation measures. Notes: Art. 27 is an ex-ante governance activity: select applicable fairness notions, compute risk indicators, set decision thresholds and escalation, define mitigations and verify effectiveness via the same mapped metrics; update FRIA when context or system version changes." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.29
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.29> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/ConditionalStatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairnessThroughAwareness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/IndividualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/itsComplianceIsSupportedWith> <http://fairness_ontology.com/AddNonToxicExamples> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/AdversarialFDP> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/AugmentedAntidoteData> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/BlocklistDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/CDA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/CalibratedReRanking> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ControlOffensiveTokens> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairPSL> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ListReAdjustment> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PerceptronForUnawareness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/REALTOXICITYPROMPTS> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnANOVA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnValueFairness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/UserItemReRanking> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Regulates the application and notification procedure for organisations that wish to act as notified bodies for high-risk AI systems, including competence requirements. Notes: Art. 29 is a meta-governance requirement: map fairness notions/metrics as assessment competence needed by notified bodies to validate provider evidence; map mitigation techniques as controls whose appropriateness/configuration/effectiveness must be reviewable and evidenced through the same indicators." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.3
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.3> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                              <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                              <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                     <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                     <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                     rdfs:comment "Provides core definitions (AI system, provider, deployer, high-risk AI system, general-purpose AI model) that allocate responsibilities for compliance with fairness and non-discrimination requirements. Notes: Art. 3 is definitional: notions/metrics are mapped as traceability anchors to assign fairness evidence and monitoring duties to the correct actor/artefact; mitigation techniques are mapped as control-accountability anchors (who implements and documents controls)." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.4
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.4> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                              <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                              <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                     <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairnessThroughAwareness> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/IndividualFairness> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                     <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                     rdfs:comment "Requires providers and deployers to take measures to ensure, to the best extent possible, a sufficient level of AI literacy for staff and other persons dealing with the operation and use of AI systems, considering their skills and the context of use. Notes: Principle/enabler: notions/metrics are mapped as training and operational interpretation anchors; the obligation is implemented via competence management (training, procedures), not via a single technical threshold." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.43
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.43> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/ConditionalStatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairnessThroughAwareness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/IndividualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/itsComplianceIsSupportedWith> <http://fairness_ontology.com/AddNonToxicExamples> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/AdversarialFDP> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/AugmentedAntidoteData> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/BlocklistDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/CDA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/CalibratedReRanking> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ControlOffensiveTokens> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairPSL> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ListReAdjustment> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PerceptronForUnawareness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/REALTOXICITYPROMPTS> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReSamplingProtectedGroup> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnANOVA> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/RegularizationOnValueFairness> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/UserItemReRanking> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Lays down rules for conformity assessment procedures for high-risk AI systems, including assessment of compliance with all applicable requirements of the Regulation. Notes: Art. 43 is an assurance gate: map notions/metrics as acceptance criteria and test evidence; map mitigations as controls whose presence/configuration/effectiveness must be demonstrable and traceable to the assessed system version (including regression evidence after changes)." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.5
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.5> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                              <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                              <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                     <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/ConditionalStatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/ErrorRateBalance> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/FairnessThroughAwareness> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/FalseNegativeErrorRateBalance> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/FalsePositiveErrorRateBalance> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/IndividualFairness> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/PredictiveEquality> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/TotalFairness> ,
                                                                                        <http://fairness_ontology.com/TreatmentEquality> ;
                                     <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                     rdfs:comment "Prohibits certain AI practices, such as exploiting vulnerabilities of specific groups, social scoring, and some forms of predictive policing, which are considered incompatible with fundamental rights and equality. Notes: Directly excludes particularly harmful and discriminatory uses of AI systems." .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.50
<http://fairness_ontology.com/Art.50> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/LegalRequirement> ,
                                               <http://fairness_ontology.com/ManagementLegalRequirement> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/isOperationalizedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Calibration> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/CounterfactualFairness> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/DemographicParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualizedOdds> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/StatisticalParity> ,
                                                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/TestFairness> ;
                                      <http://fairness_ontology.com/itsComplianceIsSupportedWith> <http://fairness_ontology.com/AddNonToxicExamples> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/BlocklistDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ControlOffensiveTokens> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/GenderneutralAlternatives> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/LogLikeDocumentRemoval> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/NamesIntervention> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/PoliteAlternatives> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/REALTOXICITYPROMPTS> ,
                                                                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/ReplaceStereotypes> ;
                                      <http://semanticscience.org/resource/SIO_000068> <http://fairness_ontology.com/EU_AI_Act> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Introduces specific transparency obligations for certain AI systems, such as those interacting with humans or detecting emotions, requiring users to be informed that they are interacting with AI. Notes: Renumbered to Art. 50 to match Regulation (EU) 2024/1689; transparency obligations mapped as operational control and risk-indicator support for discrimination detection." .


