                                                     <http://fairness_ontology.com/scientificArtifactDescription> "Add antidote data to the training data" .


###  http://fairness_ontology.com/BalanceForNegativeClass
<http://fairness_ontology.com/BalanceForNegativeClass> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
