                                                                <https://purl.org/twc/fmo#fairness_notion> ;
                                                       <http://fairness_ontology.com/extends> <http://fairness_ontology.com/PredictiveEquality> ;
                                                       <http://fairness_ontology.com/hasBeenAppliedTo> <http://fairness_ontology.com/LawAndJustice> ;
                                                       <http://fairness_ontology.com/isProposedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/2017_KLEINBERG> ;
                                                       <http://fairness_ontology.com/isUsedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/2019_DIMITRAKAKIS> ;
                                                       <http://fairness_ontology.com/refersTo> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Classification> ;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Can be viewed as a  generalization of the notion that both groups should have equal false positive rates.  [2017_KLEINBERG] ==>generalizes Predictive equality" .


