                                                <http://fairness_ontology.com/isProposedBy> <http://fairness_ontology.com/2019_DIMITRAKAKIS> ;
                                                <http://fairness_ontology.com/refersTo> <http://fairness_ontology.com/Classification> ;
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Can be viewed as a generalization of balance for pos/neg classes in case of a model where some variables are latent" .


