###  http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity
<http://fairness_ontology.com/EqualOpportunity> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/GroupFairnessNotion> ,
                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/ObservationalFairnessNotion> ,
                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/OutcomeFairnessNotion> ,
                                                         <http://fairness_ontology.com/ScientificArtifact> ,
