                                                  <http://fairness_ontology.com/scientificArtifactDescription> "Given P and Q, probability measures on a finite domain A, total variation norm suggests to compute the distance between the distributions as: $D_{\\mathrm{tv}}(P, Q) = \\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{a \\in A} | P(a) - Q(a) | .$" ;
